      "source": [
        "#### EvaluaciÃ³n de las variables mÃ¡s importantes:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Ahora seleccionaremos aquellas variables mÃ¡s importantes mediante mutual info, que mide la dependencia de las variables a al resultado"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 102,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "MonthlyIncome 0.1066457976955828\n",
            "YearsAtCompany 0.036583194483072345\n",
            "Age 0.0359224230513675\n",
            "Index(['MonthlyIncome', 'YearsAtCompany', 'Age'], dtype='object')\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "threshold = 3  # the number of most relevant features\n",
        "high_score_features = []\n",
        "\n",
        "X1 = X.apply(LabelEncoder().fit_transform)\n",
        "\n",
        "feature_scores = mutual_info_classif(X1, y, random_state=100495850)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Iterar sobre las puntuaciones de las caracterÃ­sticas y seleccionar las mÃ¡s relevantes\n",
        "for score, f_name in sorted(zip(feature_scores, X1.columns), reverse=True)[:threshold]:\n",
        "    print(f_name, score)\n",
        "    high_score_features.append(f_name)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Crear un nuevo DataFrame con las caracterÃ­sticas mÃ¡s relevantes\n",
        "df_mic = X1[high_score_features]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Imprimir las columnas seleccionadas\n",
        "print(df_mic.columns)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Podemos ver que las columnas que mÃ¡s influyen son el salario menual, el total de aÃ±os trabajados y la edad, sin embargo no tienen una gran influencia individual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "G1Dy_GMXeF30"
      },
      "source": [
        "## SVMs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mXSqnd5aw5zi"
      },
      "source": [
        "Vamos a evaluar los siguientes SVMs:\n",
        "*  Lineal\n",
        "*  Radial\n",
        "*  Polinomial\n",
        "\n",
        "Hay que destacar que en esta secciÃ³n no se probarÃ¡ grid search debido a su alto coste computacional y tiempo de ejecuciÃ³n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "GiNZHOYxw7_r"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Lineal:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 103,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OzaR6dV-v8DP"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X, y, stratify=y, test_size=0.33, random_state=100495850)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "X3D2i4ZF1eGN"
      },
      "source": [
        "Calculamos el mejor nÃºmero de splits en base a RobustScaler + Median"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 104,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1yfChnUs1ldo"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Guardar resultados para la grafica\n",
        "svm_l_results_balanced = {}\n",
        "svm_l_results_unbalanced = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "cat_transformer = Pipeline(steps=[\n",
        "    ('imputer', SimpleImputer(strategy='most_frequent')),\n",
        "    ('onehot', OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore', sparse_output=False)),\n",
        "    ('pca', PCA(n_components=5))\n",
        "])\n",
        "cat_transformer[0]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Iterar sobre cada nÃºmero de folds en la validaciÃ³n cruzada\n",
        "for fold in range(3, 11):\n",
        "    inner = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=fold, shuffle=True, random_state=100495850)\n",
        "\n",
        "    num_transformer = Pipeline(steps=[\n",
        "        ('imputer', SimpleImputer(strategy='median')),\n",
        "        ('scaler', RobustScaler())\n",
        "    ])\n",
        "\n",
        "    preprocessor = ColumnTransformer(transformers=[\n",
        "        ('num', num_transformer, num_cols),\n",
        "        ('cat', cat_transformer, cat_cols)\n",
        "    ])\n",
        "\n",
        "    pipeline = Pipeline(steps=[\n",
        "        ('preprocessor', preprocessor),\n",
        "        ('svc', SVC(C = 10, kernel = 'linear', class_weight='balanced', random_state=100495850))\n",
        "    ])\n",
        "\n",
        "    score_bal = cross_val_score(pipeline, X_train, y_train, cv=inner, scoring='balanced_accuracy').mean()\n",
        "    score_unbal = cross_val_score(pipeline, X_train, y_train, cv=inner, scoring='accuracy').mean()\n",
        "\n",
        "    key = \"RobustScaler + Median\"\n",
        "    if key not in svm_l_results_balanced:\n",
        "        svm_l_results_balanced[key] = []\n",
        "    svm_l_results_balanced[key].append((fold, score_bal))\n",
        "\n",
        "    if key not in svm_l_results_unbalanced:\n",
        "        svm_l_results_unbalanced[key] = []\n",
        "    svm_l_results_unbalanced[key].append((fold, score_unbal))"
      ]
    },
